    {
      "block_id": "b00001",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Whole Life & Life Cycle Costing",
      "ordinal": 1,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00002",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "When awarding public contracts on the basis of the Most Economically Advantageous Tender (MEAT), organisations must determine the balance between price/cost and the best price quality ratio.",
      "ordinal": 2,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00003",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "To determine the price/cost of a contract, organisations can calculate the total cost of the goods or services based on the whole lifecycle rather than only the purchase price. Using a life-cycle costing (LCC) or whole life costing (WLC) model can help organisations identify the MEAT, support obligations to improve the economic, social and environmental wellbeing of their area, and ultimately achieve value for money.",
      "ordinal": 3,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00004",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Any costs requested in a tender process should be accessible and free for bidders to provide.",
      "ordinal": 4,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00005",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Life Cycle Impact Mapping",
      "ordinal": 5,
      "heading_path": [
        "Life Cycle Impact Mapping"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00006",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Use of the Life Cycle Impact Map in the Sustainable Procurement Tools will help buyers establish where in the life cycle major social and environmental impacts occur which may be:",
      "ordinal": 6,
      "heading_path": [
        "Life Cycle Impact Mapping"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
