      "ordinal": 11,
      "heading_path": [
        "Life Cycle Impact Mapping"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00012",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Completion of a life cycle impact map can then help to identify whether a LCC or WLC approach may be appropriate.",
      "ordinal": 12,
      "heading_path": [
        "Life Cycle Impact Mapping"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00013",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Life Cycle Costing",
      "ordinal": 13,
      "heading_path": [
        "Life Cycle Impact Mapping",
        "Life Cycle Costing"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00014",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "LCC is set out in regulation 68 of the Public Contracts (Scotland) Regulations 2015.",
      "ordinal": 14,
      "heading_path": [
        "Life Cycle Impact Mapping",
        "Life Cycle Costing"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00015",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Although this provision does not extend to regulated procurements below the 2015 thresholds, the use of a life cycle approach will support an organisation’s responsibility to consider how to support its sustainable procurement duty to improve the economic, social and environmental wellbeing of its area, achieve the MEAT and help achieve value for money. Using this approach will also help increase the transparency of possible future costs to organisations.",
      "ordinal": 15,
      "heading_path": [
        "Life Cycle Impact Mapping",
        "Life Cycle Costing"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00016",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "LCC will cover part or all of the costs relating to the lifecycle of the goods or services. These can include costs such as:",
      "ordinal": 16,
      "heading_path": [
        "Life Cycle Impact Mapping",
        "Life Cycle Costing"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00017",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Purchase price",
      "ordinal": 17,
      "heading_path": [
        "Life Cycle Impact Mapping",
        "Life Cycle Costing"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00018",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Purchase price",
      "ordinal": 18,
      "heading_path": [
        "Life Cycle Impact Mapping",
        "Life Cycle Costing"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00019",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Operating costs such as fuel costs, consumables",
      "ordinal": 19,
      "heading_path": [
        "Life Cycle Impact Mapping",
        "Life Cycle Costing"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00020",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Operating costs such as fuel costs, consumables",
      "ordinal": 20,
      "heading_path": [
        "Life Cycle Impact Mapping",
        "Life Cycle Costing"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00021",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Maintenance costs such as servicing, repairs and spare parts",
      "ordinal": 21,
      "heading_path": [
        "Life Cycle Impact Mapping",
        "Life Cycle Costing"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
